{"name": "Darfall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8c8f527a39e446e5749ff38c164861bb.poster.avif?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8c8f527a39e446e5749ff38c164861bb.webm?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8c8f527a39e446e5749ff38c164861bb.mp4?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/fa41593c00af72694c1f496a84b05c7d.webp?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand against the undead hordes in a campaign inspired by fantasy classics. Discover the continent of Aganor across many challenging missions, push back the darkness, and protect your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/f012c72265f75ab29f6c9962316d8dfc.webp?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the day to gather resources, fortify your town, and explore the surrounding lands. When the night falls, defend your people and their homes against the waves of enemies, until the break of dawn.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8fbcdaf09a153d1960ea97feb6418a49.poster.avif?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8fbcdaf09a153d1960ea97feb6418a49.webm?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/8fbcdaf09a153d1960ea97feb6418a49.mp4?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/92884d56da103a1e1f19c080b3a38456.webp?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the challenges with the help of legendary heroes - wizards, warriors, and more. Utilize their varied skills, level them up, and arm them with powerful artifacts won throughout your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/433a3905027c4070964cea9c2e774352.poster.avif?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/433a3905027c4070964cea9c2e774352.webm?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/433a3905027c4070964cea9c2e774352.mp4?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/2f0dba61238dd361823b4ff98614190c.webp?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own scenarios, maps, quests, and even whole, scripted campaigns with an extensive in-game editor. Share your creations with other players and set your imagination free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/9777a9981656ca7a663db2b40fa8a116.webp?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test yourself in a challenging survival mode, where every night brings new, growing terrors. Survive the onslaught, and rebuild every morning to face the undead hordes again. Fight until you win glory\u2026 or reprieve in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/6c697b80ec96f8b39fe2674c4baca614.poster.avif?t=1763378013\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/6c697b80ec96f8b39fe2674c4baca614.webm?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/6c697b80ec96f8b39fe2674c4baca614.mp4?t=1763378013\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Darfall is a hero-based RPG city-building game that puts you in the role of a hero who must protect their home and help it grow! During the day, grow your hero\u2019s might, find epic loot, master new abilities, and fortify your settlement. At night, survive the hordes of undead, until you triumph.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/header.jpg?t=1763378013", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Base Building", "RTS", "Strategy", "City Builder", "Survival", "Combat"], "developers": "SquareNite", "publishers": "SquareNite", "release_date": "May 8, 2025", "price": "$24.99", "appid": "1961600", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/cvesGvpsGjw", "first_seen": 1739923200.0, "review_rank": 1805}